<title>JAPAN: Sony shares surge to another record high.</title>
<headline>Sony shares surge to another record high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of electronics giant Sony Corp surged to another record high on Wednesday morning, breaking through the previous high marked on Tuesday, helped by the easier yen against the dollar, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price briefly jumped to 10,500, a new all-time high. At 0100 GMT, the shares were 300 yen higher at 10,400. Volume was 835,100 shares.</p>
